[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Three Men in a Basket]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.12]Where was the station's Commanding Officer? | 基地的指挥官在哪里？
[00:16.33]A pilot noticed a balloon which seemed to be making for a Royal Air Force station nearby. | 一位飞行员发现了一只气球，它像是正朝附近的一个皇家空军基地飞去。
[00:24.07]He informed the station at once, but no one there was able to explain the mystery. | 他立即报告了基地，但那里没有人能解释这个谜。
[00:31.75]The officer in the control tower was very angry when he heard the news, | 控制塔上的军官听到这个消息时非常生气，
[00:37.89]because balloons can be a great danger to aircraft. | 因为气球可能给飞机造成极大的危险。
[00:42.83]He said that someone might be spying on the station and the pilot was ordered to keep track of the strange object. | 他说可能有人在侦察基地，于是飞行员奉命跟踪这个奇怪的物体。
[00:52.04]The pilot managed to circle the balloon for some time. | 飞行员设法绕着气球飞了一阵子。
[00:56.94]He could make out three men in a basket under it and one of them was holding a pair of binoculars. | 他看清了气球下面篮子里的3个人，其中一个拿着双筒望远镜。
[01:04.92]When the balloon was over the station, the pilot saw one of the men taking photographs. | 当气球飞临基地上空时，飞行员看见其中一人正在拍照。
[01:12.18]Soon afterwards, the balloon began to descend and it landed near an airfield. | 不久，气球开始下降，在一个机场附近着陆了。
[01:19.25]The police were called in, but they could not arrest anyone, | 警察被召来了，但他们不能逮捕任何人，
[01:24.01]for the basket contained two Members of Parliament and the Commanding Officer of the station! | 因为篮子里装着两位国会议员和基地的指挥官！
[01:31.62]As the Commanding Officer explained later, one half of the station did not know what the other half was doing! | 正如指挥官后来解释的那样，基地的这一半人不知道另一半人在干什么！
